<title>CHINA: Indosuez WI Carr plans warrants on red chip basket.</title>
<headline>Indosuez WI Carr plans warrants on red chip basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indosuez W.I. Carr (Derivatives) Ltd said on Thursday it planned to issue 280 million American-style call warrants on a basket of red chips.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p> China Everbright-IHD Pacific Ltd	   0.058 shrs</p>
<p> China Merchants Holdings Co Int'l Co Ltd 0.058 shrs</p>
<p> CITIC Pacific Ltd				0.052 shrs</p>
<p> Ten warrants control one basket. (Indicative terms)</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$4.394    PREMIUM	27.10 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.181    GEARING	2.7x</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$4.882    BOARD LOT    10,000</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   ONE YR FROM ISSUE DATE</p>
<p> ISSUE DATE	   TO BE ANNOUNCED</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
